    "intro_html":  "This is the homemade answer to the boxed cheeseburger-pasta stuff, except the beef is real, the cheese is real, and the math is better. Each bowl packs \u003cstrong\u003e41 grams of protein\u003c/strong\u003e and 616 calories for about \u003cstrong\u003e$3.27\u003c/strong\u003e (at everyday cost). One pot, no powder packets, no regrets.",
